{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-23T23:21:34.372Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"a51e48fd5514a5741ef185a2","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"**Version:** 2026.10.23. **Scope:** core exported `PmBulkMutationControlOptions`, `PmUpdateManyActionOptions` and `PmCloseManyActionOptions`. **Severity:** low SDK correctness / recovery authoring friction.\n\nIn the scratch package, compile this file:\n\n```ts\nimport type { PmUpdateManyActionOptions,\n  PmCloseManyActionOptions } from '@unbrained/pm-cli';\nconst update: PmUpdateManyActionOptions = { rollback: 'update-many-checkpoint' };\nconst close: PmCloseManyActionOptions = { rollback: 'close-many-checkpoint' };\nconsole.log(update, close);\n```\n\nCommand: `npx tsc --noEmit --strict --skipLibCheck --module nodenext --target es2023 --types node bulk-types.ts`.\n\n**Observed:** two TS2322 errors: string is not assignable to boolean or undefined. Replacing strings with true compiles, but passing those option bags to `PmClient.run('update-many', { options })` / `run('close-many', { options })` does not request rollback. The former reports no mutation flags; the latter reports missing close filters. The boolean does not name a checkpoint and is dropped from rollback dispatch.\n\nCLI help correctly declares `--rollback <value>`, and the lower-level `runUpdateMany`/`runCloseMany` structured option declarations correctly use string. Those working APIs provide a workaround; the defect is the exported flat bulk action types, not absence of SDK recovery.\n\n**Expected:** type rollback as a checkpoint ID string, sharing the runtime contract. Reject boolean inputs with a rollback-specific diagnostic instead of dispatching as an ordinary forward bulk operation. Add a packed-consumer type check accepting actual checkpoint IDs for both action types.\n\n**Measured cost:** the two compiler diagnostics occupy **196 bytes / 49 estimated tokens**. The accepted-boolean runtime control required two dispatcher calls and returned refusal strings rather than performing recovery: its compact serialized error objects total **737 bytes / 184.25 estimated tokens**. Compilation failure is not a successful restore. No state loss occurred in this control.\n\n**Duplicate searches**, same all-state limit-20 command:\n\n- `\"rollback\" \"boolean\"`\n- `\"PmBulkMutationControlOptions\"`\n- `\"PmUpdateManyActionOptions\"`\n- `\"PmCloseManyActionOptions\"`\n- `\"rollback\" \"SDK\"`\n- `\"rollback\" \"type\"`\n- `\"rollback\" \"checkpoint\" \"typing\"`\n\nNo matching exported-rollback-type report found. Results include broad SDK/preview and workspace restore reports, not this boolean/string declaration mismatch. This draft is distinct from Draft 1's actual rollback state semantics."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1564"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1564: align SDK bulk rollback checkpoint types and runtime admission"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"External report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1564. Revalidate the reported 2026.10.23 behavior against the checkout before implementation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["github-intake","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-23T23:21:34.372Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-23T23:21:34.372Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Public update-many and close-many action options accept string checkpoint IDs and reject booleans; invalid untyped rollback inputs fail before ordinary forward execution; packed consumer type and runtime proof pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-usfg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-23T23:21:34.372Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check 2026-10-24: canonical orientation, request-specific SDK/rollback search, fresh open and in_progress lists, and complete strict all-status read of 3083 items including 2799 closed and 14 canceled; no omissions or unreadable files. Exact GitHub issue and title checks found no existing owner for this delta. Closed SDK/bulk foundations were read live and remain completed. Source report retained in full; intake is not reproduction proof."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"b0effbe0351b49ebb831019c4348599e7ee416253c8317c87d981bd5110fd1b4","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ebcf27f09d0ba2fa6a59d4d21be7e6071fafafab21200afc16acf2ded12daba3"}
